      "SectionPath": [
        "Start Building Now",
        "Step 2: Request Development Tier Access (1 minute)"
      ],
      "Text": "In your new app, go to the Products tab\nFind Verified on LinkedIn in the product list\nClick Request access\nReview and accept Terms and Conditions\nAutomatic approval - Refresh page after 1-2 minutes to see status change",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
