      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 5: Generate Access Token (3-legged OAuth)",
      "Anchor": "step-5-generate-access-token-3-legged-oauth",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Start Building Now",
        "Step 5: Generate Access Token (3-legged OAuth)"
      ],
      "Text": "This video explains how LinkedIn OAuth works for Verified on LinkedIn, including scopes, redirects, and token exchange.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 5: Generate Access Token (3-legged OAuth)",
      "Anchor": "step-5-generate-access-token-3-legged-oauth",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Start Building Now",
        "Step 5: Generate Access Token (3-legged OAuth)"
      ],
      "Text": "To generate a token during development:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Option A: Use OAuth Tool (Fastest)",
      "Anchor": "option-a-use-oauth-tool-fastest",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Start Building Now",
        "Step 5: Generate Access Token (3-legged OAuth)",
        "Option A: Use OAuth Tool (Fastest)"
      ],
      "Text": "Go to OAuth Tool and select your developer app\nSelect scopes: r_profile_basicinfo and r_verify\nClick Request access token\nAuthorize with your LinkedIn account\nCopy the generated access token",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Option B: Build OAuth Flow (Production-Ready)",
      "Anchor": "option-b-build-oauth-flow-production-ready",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Start Building Now",
        "Step 5: Generate Access Token (3-legged OAuth)",
        "Option B: Build OAuth Flow (Production-Ready)"
      ],
      "Text": "For production use, implement the full 3-legged OAuth flow in your application:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Option B: Build OAuth Flow (Production-Ready)",
      "Anchor": "option-b-build-oauth-flow-production-ready",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Start Building Now",
        "Step 5: Generate Access Token (3-legged OAuth)",
        "Option B: Build OAuth Flow (Production-Ready)"
      ],
      "Text": "Review the authentication documentation for the complete OAuth sequence, including authorization, token exchange, and refresh handling.\nFollow the integration best practices guide for secure token storage, redirect handling, and recommended architecture.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Option B: Build OAuth Flow (Production-Ready)",
      "Anchor": "option-b-build-oauth-flow-production-ready",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Start Building Now",
        "Step 5: Generate Access Token (3-legged OAuth)",
        "Option B: Build OAuth Flow (Production-Ready)"
      ],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Option B: Build OAuth Flow (Production-Ready)",
      "Anchor": "option-b-build-oauth-flow-production-ready",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Start Building Now",
        "Step 5: Generate Access Token (3-legged OAuth)",
        "Option B: Build OAuth Flow (Production-Ready)"
      ],
      "Text": "The state parameter is a standard OAuth 2.0 parameter used to pass per-request session data, such as CSRF tokens, session identifiers, or routing context.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Option B: Build OAuth Flow (Production-Ready)",
      "Anchor": "option-b-build-oauth-flow-production-ready",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Start Building Now",
        "Step 5: Generate Access Token (3-legged OAuth)",
        "Option B: Build OAuth Flow (Production-Ready)"
      ],
      "Text": "Example:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Option B: Build OAuth Flow (Production-Ready)",
      "Anchor": "option-b-build-oauth-flow-production-ready",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Start Building Now",
        "Step 5: Generate Access Token (3-legged OAuth)",
        "Option B: Build OAuth Flow (Production-Ready)"
      ],
      "Text": "https://example.com/callback?state=abc123",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Option B: Build OAuth Flow (Production-Ready)",
      "Anchor": "option-b-build-oauth-flow-production-ready",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Start Building Now",
        "Step 5: Generate Access Token (3-legged OAuth)",
        "Option B: Build OAuth Flow (Production-Ready)"
      ],
      "Text": "When used with Verified on LinkedIn verification flows, the state parameter is preserved and returned to your registered redirectUri after verification completes.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
